  {
   "id": "until-dawn-284721@1.08",
   "gameId": "until-dawn-284721",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.08",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-05T16:48:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Welcome back, friends and fans!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Until Dawn Patch 1.08 is now live for PS5 and PC. We've bumped the patch up a version, as we released a small hotfix patch for PS5 earlier in the month (1.07).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "🔧 Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disabled the ability to have TAA on when FSR is on",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Player choice percentage telemetry is now correctly tracking across all platforms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't Move inputs respect key bindings correctly (e.g. AZERTY keyboards)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The It's Shining trophy/achievement can now be unlocked when gathering the interactions from Episode Select",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Symphony of Horrors achievement no longer unlocks early in some instances",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes for stuttering issues when Mike is in the Sanatorium in Chapter 9",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes for butterfly effects showing the wrong informtion at the end of playthroughs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Josh's Character screen now appears in Chapter 10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The shader compilation start up process has been changed. There is now a shorter initial compilation screen, with some of it taking place in the menu. If you attempt to start the game during compilation, you will hit a warning screen (You can revert to the old system by launching the game with the command -legacypso via Steam Launcher)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Movement prompt now appears during the deer approach in Chapter 6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Carnival of Solitude achievement no longer requires gyroscope function to unlock on Steam Deck",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If experiencing a crash on boot while playing on Steam Deck, please switch to Proton Experimental in the compatibility settings of your device",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay safe... it's dark out there. 💀⛰️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Ballistic Moon",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
